        "en": "Helpful and knowledgeable shop assistants"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers consistently praise the shop staff for their warm welcome, practical guidance, and attentiveness. Named team members like Dez, Kiddy, Mendez, and Alex receive frequent commendations for explaining aquatic setup requirements and helping visitors carry supplies. Reviewers appreciate the approachable, community-focused customer service."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Well-stocked store with broad selection"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors highlight the extensive range of pet supplies and livestock packed into the Great Barr premises. Reviewers frequently note healthy freshwater and tropical fish selections, aquarium plants, reptile equipment, and specialty feeds. Customers appreciate that the shop can place orders for specific accessories if an item is not immediately on the shelf."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Fair pricing across pet supplies"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers consistently report that prices for fish, raw feeds, and natural dog treats are very competitive compared to larger chain retailers. Reviewers appreciate the good value offered across aquatic equipment, aquarium plants, and everyday pet essentials, noting that quality remains high without inflated retail markups."
      }
    }
